[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=19 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="门外的光比你想象中普通。云散开一小块，照在破损的栏杆和起毛的绳上；海面仍然有浮油，浪也没有因为一场胜利变得温柔。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="点名。按刚才的顺序。"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="大家轮流回应。有一段频道断了几秒，你握紧耳机，直到拉姆森在另一边骂了一句插头，才发现自己已经站了起来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="人在。箱子也在。别替我写悼词，先给我留块能修东西的地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那你听见我说你工具箱乱了吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="听见了。回去以后你整理。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你笑了一下，笑到一半才觉得很累。潮痕靠着栏杆坐下，没有去看门。你问她，拒绝同步的人后来有没有留下其他东西，她说有，待会儿给你看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="不用现在。你可以先休息。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="你不怕我又拖着不说？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="怕。所以我会再问。但不是趁你还没缓过来的时候。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她闭上眼，很轻地应了一声。弗莱彻把干布递过来，先擦你的手，再让你擦耳机。你的手心有一道被指甲压出来的痕迹，已经不怎么疼了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="原记录封存，副本两份。交接表、名单和中止申请都在，没有只拿结论。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那封信呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="也在。信封没有地址，回去以后我们可以查人，而不是替他决定信没有用。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你看向门，还是有一点想回头的冲动。那里面也许有你的名字，也许只有别人替你写好的话。你没有把这个念头藏起来，告诉德雷顿以后，她把频道又检查了一遍。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="以后再来，我们多带一卷胶带。这次总算知道哪儿容易漏了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

